\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {I}{\ignorespaces Physical-target hit counts and finite-test 95-percent Clopper--Pearson intervals. $N=4096$ for every row. Calibration uses 8191 separate draws; calibration-content uncertainty is distinct from these test intervals.}}{2}{}}
